{"title":"毛主席在四川","authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1958,"month":4,"day":17}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上:毛主席亲切地问农民高浡然有多大岁数，孩子读书没有。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中:毛主席视察灌县新城乡莲花一社时向社员冉贵全了解粮食产量。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下:都江堰管理处长张建中向毛主席汇报灌溉情况。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【四川日报供稿　陈岳峰摄】"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陈岳峰"}],"comments":[],"origin":"","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}